"dialogs": [
{
"sid": 50,
"uid": "D_BEDROOM",
"content": {
"sentence": {
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 4,
"text": {
"en": "The door looks broken, I hope there's nothing useful inside..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
},
{
"id": 6,
"text": {
"en": "There is a lock on that drawer, I need a key..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
},
{
"id": 7,
"text": {
"en": "A knife, I hope I will not use it..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
},
{
"id": 8,
"text": {
"en": "There is a plush behind him, he seems quite attached to it..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
}
]
},
"nextID": 9
}
},
{
"sid": 51,
"uid": "D_HERO",
"content": {
"sentence": {
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 1,
"text": {
"en": "It's locked..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
},
{
"id": 3,
"text": {
"en": "It doesn't work..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
}
]
},
"nextID": 6
}
},
{
"sid": 52,
"uid": "D_HALL",
"content": {
"sentence": {
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 6,
"text": {
"en": "They've locked me inside... Guess I'll need to find a way to escape myself."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
}
]
},
"nextID": 7
}
},
{
"sid": 53,
"uid": "D_DANCINGROOM",
"content": {
"sentence": {
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 6,
"text": {
"en": "It's a piece of chalk, I don't really know what to do with it."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
},
{
"id": 7,
"text": {
"en": "Nice ! I found the chalk !"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
}
]
},
"nextID": 8
}
},
{
"sid": 54,
"uid": "D_ATTIC",
"content": {
"sentence": {
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 6,
"text": {
"en": "Just a bunch of old books..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
},
{
"id": 8,
"text": {
"en": "Oh, that looks like the pattern that the other ghost told me about !"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 9,
"text": {
"en": "\"Ritual to send ghosts where they belong :\""
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 10,
"text": {
"en": "\"You'll need a red chalk, some candles, an object that is important to the ghost and 12 years old's blood\""
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 11,
"text": {
"en": "\"Draw the sigyl and dispose the objects like the picture, then repeat 3 time the na-\""
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 12,
"text": {
"en": "The rest of the page has been torn apart..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
}
],
"speaker": "O_HERO"
}
],
"speaker": "O_HERO"
}
],
"speaker": "O_HERO"
}
],
"speaker": "O_HERO"
},
{
"id": 15,
"text": {
"en": "What could I use candles for..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
},
{
"id": 16,
"text": {
"en": "Here's the candles !"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
},
{
"id": 18,
"text": {
"en": "The scales won't hold"
},
"speaker": "O_HERO",
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
}
}
]
},
"nextID": 19
}
},
{
"sid": 55,
"uid": "D_CORRIDOR",
"content": {
"sentence": {
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 7,
"text": {
"en": "It's too high for me, I'll need a tool..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
},
{
"id": 8,
"text": {
"en": "It's empty..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
},
{
"id": 10,
"text": {
"en": "A key fell from the attic trapdoor..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
},
{
"id": 11,
"text": {
"en": "That painting says 1986, is that a clue ?"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_PICTURE"
},
{
"id": 12,
"text": {
"en": "What a strange painting..."
},
"speaker": "O_HERO",
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
}
}
]
},
"nextID": 13
}
},
{
"sid": 56,
"uid": "D_GARDEN",
"content": {
"sentence": {
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 6,
"text": {
"en": "Mmmh, a stick... Maybe it'll help be reach high things."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
},
{
"id": 7,
"text": {
"en": "A lighter, i could always use a bit of light..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
}
]
},
"nextID": 8
}
},
{
"sid": 57,
"uid": "D_SPECTRE1",
"content": {
"sentence": {
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 6,
"text": {
"en": "Hello hello little one ! Welcome to my home ! What brings you in a place like this ?"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 7,
"text": {
"en": "Hi, is it really your home ? Some bullies trapped me inside, I'm sorry, I'm leaving right now."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 9,
"text": {
"en": "Oh so you're just like me ! I also got trapped here, but I wasn't able to get out... These jerks told everybody I threw myself off the Pottown Cliff."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 10,
"text": {
"en": "Wait, so you're... a ghost ?"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 11,
"text": {
"en": "Yeah, you could call me that, but I prefer Leo. Don't worry, I will not harm you. I want to help you get out."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 12,
"text": {
"en": "That's nice of you ! how would you do that ?"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 13,
"text": {
"en": "You know, I have the entire control over this house, unlocking the door is a piece of cake for me ! But you'll need to help me first."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 14,
"text": {
"en": "Sure, I'll do anything to get out of here, no offense."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 15,
"text": {
"en": "The only thing I want is to finally be free of this house, if you can free me, I'll open the door for you. Good Luck !"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 16,
"text": {
"en": "Okay I'll see what I can do..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_HERO"
}
],
"speaker": "O_SPECTRE1"
}
],
"speaker": "O_HERO"
}
],
"speaker": "O_SPECTRE1"
}
],
"speaker": "O_HERO"
}
],
"speaker": "O_SPECTRE1"
}
],
"speaker": "O_HERO"
}
],
"speaker": "O_SPECTRE1"
}
],
"speaker": "O_HERO"
}
],
"speaker": "O_SPECTRE1"
},
{
"id": 21,
"text": {
"en": "Leave me alone for now, I can't do anything for you right now."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_SPECTRE1"
},
{
"id": 24,
"text": {
"en": "Hello again, can I help you with anything ?"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 25,
"choice": true,
"text": {
