]
},
"text": {
"en": "Hello !"
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 9,
"text": {
"en": "Hi, that's quite rare to see a new face in here..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 19,
"choice": true,
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"text": {
"en": "Who are you ?"
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 29,
"text": {
"en": "Im Collin Ryder ! The great occult streamer !"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_SPECTRE2"
}
]
},
{
"id": 20,
"choice": true,
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"text": {
"en": "How did you get trapped here ?"
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 30,
"text": {
"en": "I was doing a vlog for my channel and entered this house, I got trapped here and I died trying to help Leo."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_SPECTRE2"
}
]
},
{
"id": 21,
"choice": true,
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"text": {
"en": "Do you know Leo ?"
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 31,
"text": {
"en": "Yeah, he's a nice guy to talk to, but I don't know why he keep us trap here. He could've open the door for me or you."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 33,
"text": {
"en": "Maybe it's he's plan. Trapping people to achieve he's objective..."
},
"voice": {
