"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"text": {
"en": "And how do I make the ritual."
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 37,
"text": {
"en": "Try to look in the attic, I think I saw a book on occult rituals up there. It's sad I didn't think much of it at the time..."
